    title: "Antique & Jewelry Appraisal Leads: A Guide for Personal Property Appraisers",
    metaTitle: "Antique and Jewelry Appraisal Leads Guide",
    excerpt: "How personal property appraisers find clients needing antique, jewelry, and estate item appraisals for insurance, probate, and resale purposes.",
