    title: "Interior Design & Decorating Leads: A Guide for Design Professionals",
    metaTitle: "Interior Design and Decorating Leads Guide",
    excerpt: "How interior designers generate leads for full-service design projects, from space planning to furnishing, and how this differs from smaller decorating work.",
