    slug: "picture-hanger-leads",
    title: "Picture Hanging Leads: A Guide for Handyman Businesses",
    metaTitle: "Picture Hanging Leads for Handyman Businesses",
    excerpt: "How handyman businesses generate leads for professional picture and art hanging, a small, fast job that rewards volume and efficient scheduling.",
