    slug: "same-day-house-cleaning-leads",
    title: "Same-Day House Cleaning Leads: A Guide for Cleaning Companies",
    metaTitle: "Same-Day House Cleaning Leads Guide",
    excerpt: "How cleaning companies generate leads for urgent, same-day cleaning requests, and how to price and staff for this fast-turnaround niche.",
